<title>ANGOLA: SOCCER-ANGOLA BEAT ZIMBABWE 2-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ANGOLA BEAT ZIMBABWE 2-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an African Nations Cup</p>
<p>group one qualifier on Sunday:</p>
<p>Angola 2  Zimbabwe 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Angola - Paulao 10, Akua 70</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Stuart 78</p>
<p>Final standings</p>
<p>		    P  W  D  L  F  A Pts</p>
<p>    1. Ghana    4  2  1  1  4  3   7</p>
<p>    2. Angola   4  2  0  2  4  4   6</p>
<p>    3. Zimbabwe 4  1  1  2  3  4   4</p>
<p>	 Ghana and Angola qualify for finals.</p>
</text>
